    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I'm a bit worried about how it'll land. The sentiment score on this draft came back a little lower than I'd like—it's around a 0.6. \n\nI know I said not to chase the number, but if it's too low, the client might think we aren't being proactive enough in showing we care. Could you try another version? Try to make it feel a bit more warm and positive so we don't come across as cold or robotic, but please, please keep it professional. I really don't want it to sound like we're happy that they had a bad experience.",
      "source": "evaluator"
